400">Fiecare piesă de album descărcată include grafica albumului, numele artistului, titlul melodiei și numărul piesei încorporate automat. Biblioteca dvs. muzicală rămâne perfect organizată fără niciun efort manual.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 max-w-[980px] mx-auto px-3 w-full"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 tracking-tight">Spotify Album Downloader – Întrebări frecvente</h2><div class="h-1.5 w-16 bg-[#0f853c] dark:bg-[#1db954] mx-auto rounded-md"></div></div><div class="p-2 md:p-6 rounded-md border bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] dark:bg-[#121212] dark:border-white/10 dark:shadow-none"><div class="border-b last:border-0 border-black/5 dark:border-white/5"><button class="w-full py-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left group cursor-pointer px-4" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg transition-colors flex-1 pr-4 group-hover:text-[#0f7a35] dark:group-hover:text-[#1db954] text-black dark:text-white">Ce este un program de descărcare a albumelor Spotify?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:text-[#0f7a35] dark:group-hover:text-[#1db954] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><div class="border-b last:border-0 border-black/5 dark:border-white/5"><button class="w-full py-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left group cursor-pointer px-4" aria-expanded="false"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg transition-colors flex-1 pr-4 group-hover:text-[#0f7a35] dark:group-hover:text-[#1db954] text-black dark:text-white">Este SpotSaver Spotify descărcatorul de albume gratuit?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke